。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Kinesis 软件支持用户通过 PC 的 USB 总线与任意数量的硬件控制单元进行交互。该程序可同时显示多个图形化仪器面板，实现对多台设备的集中控制。用户可通过软件配置所有基础运行参数，并执行基本操作（如电机运动）。硬件配置与参数设置支持保存和重新加载功能，极大简化了系统部署流程。","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.thorlabs.com/","releaseDate":"2025-09-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.thorlabs.com/Software/Motion Control/KINESIS/Application/v1.14.56/History.txt","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/t/Thorlabs/Kinesis/x86/1.14.56.0/Thorlabs.Kinesis.x86.yaml","sha256":"906bbe7b0650cff6e3441cbfcffb5aa3d182eda8c2d1316eb1378ccd89fc1215"},{"path":"manifests/t/Thorlabs/Kinesis/x86/1.14.56.0/Thorlabs.Kinesis.x86.installer.yaml","sha256":"857ec0887735bbdb86d54940471be90253998a66b2ac4741765d1f65b3e8480a"},{"path":"manifests/t/Thorlabs/Kinesis/x86/1.14.56.0/Thorlabs.Kinesis.x86.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"fa886ff1c0e6b2f5e8b39217e7f4cafcfb34c4356d3f4e564a1bc1e5edf39e05"},{"path":"manifests/t/Thorlabs/Kinesis/x86/1.14.56.0/Thorlabs.Kinesis.x86.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"3a70993fdd4640c88124dd0e8b6d3d370cf6cc7f45e80e3059dcf1d7603ed2bc"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.14.56.0"}